cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its research walkthroughs, please cite this repository."
title: "CWRU Bearing Diagnosis and Generalization"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Ali"
    family-names: "Mirzaabolhassani"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Undergraduate research software for inspecting CWRU bearing vibration signals,
  FFT and Hilbert-envelope exploration, bearing-frequency rules, classical
  feature and SVM baselines, STFT representations, and EfficientNet-B0
  experiments across operating loads and fault sizes. The repository preserves
  historical results and provides supported notebooks and prospective execution
  code. Original trained weights are unavailable; full historical training has
  not been independently reproduced.
keywords:
  - bearing fault diagnosis
  - CWRU
  - signal processing
  - transfer learning
